{"sourceUrl":"https://szmed.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/article/3377","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:15.057448+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://szmed.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/article/3377","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span><font>中山大学医学院是中山大学医科在新时代的传承与发展，学院于</font><font>2016</font><font>年首届招生，是深圳校区建设最早、规模最大的学院。</font></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。现有全日制在读学生2351人，其中本科生2061人，研究生290人。已毕业</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生1471人，其中本科生1238人，研究生233人。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>中山大学医学院以国家“</span></span></span><span><span><span>新医科</span></span></span><span><span><span>”改革为背景，继承中大医科优良传统，坚持临床导向，加强基础与临床深度融合，培养医德高尚、符合新时代需求、临床胜任力强、具备交叉学科知识、能解决医学前沿问题的卓越医学创新人才。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>     <span><span><span>为增进优秀大学生对医学院的了解，加深对当前生物医学研究前沿与热点的认识，培养从事科学研究的兴趣，计划招收</span></span></span><span><span><span>活动学生</span></span></span><span><span><span>约</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>0名，最终招收名额视报名情况而定，</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><font>本次活动只作学院宣讲和师生交流</font></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>     <b><span><span><span><span>7月9</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>,</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>中山大学</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>医学</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>院将在</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>中山大学深圳校区医学园1-南107会议室</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>举办优秀大学生学术交流暨招生宣讲活动。欢迎各位学子</span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span>报名参加！</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span> 一、申请报名活动资格</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）来自全国</span></span></span><span><span><span>各高校2026年</span></span></span><span><span><span>医学、生物学、药学、数理、信息交叉学科等相关专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>应届</span></span></span><span><span><span>优秀</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科毕业生</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>即将于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月份进入最后一学年学习的本科生</span></span></span><span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）有志从事科学研究，具有良好的培养潜质，学习成绩优秀。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（三）具有良好听、说、读、写的英语应用能力。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span>二、提交申请</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>请于2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年6月2</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>前在以下网址提交报名信息：<a href=\"https://doc.weixin.qq.com/forms/AM8AXAcdAA0AfYAtQa9AF8CNsE8CBP1yf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://doc.weixin.qq.com/forms/AM8AXAcdAA0AfYAtQa9AF8CNsE8CBP1yf</a>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>所有</span></span></span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span><span><span><span>材料</span></span></span><span><span><span>按顺序</span></span></span><span><span><span>合并成1个PDF上传，命名为：姓名-本科就读学校-联系电话</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>提交的附件不按照规定命名的视为无效文件处理，请务必确认材料信息无误后再提交。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1、 个人简历；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2、本科阶段成绩单（由教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3、学生证复印件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4、身份证正反面复印件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5、</span></span></span><span><span><span>学信网《</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span>三、审核流程</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>审核工作由中山大学医学院研究生办公室根据上交材料进行综合考察，将于7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月2日前审核结束。入选参加活动的学生名单将在“学院网站</span></span></span><span><span><span>-教务教学-招生专业”进行公布，并通过短信或电子邮件方式通知本人，请在当天确认是否确定参加。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span>四、活动安排</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>本次招生宣讲活动初定线下形式组织,活动时间2</span></span></span><span><span><span>天</span></span></span><span><span><span>,内容包括招宣活动主题讲座、相关实验室师生专题交流等，基本日程安排如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>      <span><span><span>7月</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>下</span></span></span><span><span><span>午：学生报到；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>      <span><span><span>7月</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>日上午：</span></span></span><span><span><span>学术</span></span></span><span><span><span>讲座</span></span></span><span><span><span>、招生宣讲；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>      <span><span><span>7月</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>下午</span></span></span><span><span><span>：与</span></span></span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span><span><span><span>交流、</span></span></span><span><span><span>参观科研实验室及校园、签退。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span>说明：</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、以上日程为拟定计划，具体安排可能会根据</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>实际工作情况适当调整。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>、招生宣讲活动只作</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>宣讲和师生交流。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、对于入选学生，我院</span></span></span><span><span><span>协助解决</span></span></span><span><span><span>住宿</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>其余费用自理</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）通讯地址：广东省深圳市光明区公常路66号中山大学深圳校区医学园1-南105A。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）联系人、电话：张老师、</span></span></span><span><span><span>蒋老师，</span></span></span><span><span><span>0755-2326031</span></span></span><span><span><span>5、23260314。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（三）邮箱：zhanglli35@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（四）医学院相关网址：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.中山大学医学院师资概况：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><a href=\"https://szmed.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/teachers/professor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://szmed.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/teachers/professor</a></span></span></span><span><span>  </span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>                                                 <span><span><span>中山大学医学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>                                                    <span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span><span><span><span>6月11</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"267453a81a861ca42e384dc0b82d6355df451389c1c8af8ce17248bfa1c910f6","textLength":1293,"sourceSha256":"48066127b20491eae2b1499814eb339d2071b905f90191c78110b838ffb4f663","selector":".field-body","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-28ace489d5916926e5d1","title":"2025年中山大学医学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:15.057448+00:00"}
